{"articleNo":"164875","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=164875&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017년 상반기 공기업 인사담당자 취업특강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.01.16","hit":"2529","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">서초구청에서는 청년일자리 문제 해소 및 청년취업 지원을 위하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">예금보험공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대한무역투자진흥공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">(KOTRA) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">담당자를 초빙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2017 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공기업 인사담당자 취업특강</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 아래와 같이 개최하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">관련분야 취업에 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><img style=\"HEIGHT: 906px; WIDTH: 649px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/04c63c01-8556-4552-aab3-70923186baf6.jpg\" width=\"1190\" height=\"1683\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
